        <h1>The Favicon Files You Actually Need, <em>and the Tags to Paste</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">A plain guide to favicons in 2026: how many files you really need (far fewer than the old twenty-plus), which formats do what, the exact link tags for the head of your page, and where the icon for iOS and Android fits in. The Best Answer Hub Favicon Generator makes the modern set from an image, text, or emoji, entirely in your browser.</p>
        <div class="byline"><span><b>Best Answer Hub</b></span><span>~8 min read</span><span>2026 best practice</span><span>No signup</span></div>
